  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism: narrow toothless snout and stiff armoured back. Not a whale, isolated skull or Parahupehsuchus body tube. [\"2023 filter-feeding inference is challenged by2025 PeerJ19666; preserve uncertainty, no invented whale soft tissues.\", \"Colour, skin, exact flesh depth and paddle outline inferred. Fossil compression not living body thickness; distal tail outline reconstructed, not fully shown in figure.\", \"Do not substitute related short-necked Eohupehsuchus proportions or Parahupehsuchus extreme bony body tube.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.0, \"basis\": \"Chen et al.2014 discussion places Hupehsuchus around1m. Genus-level reconstruction target, not measured length of2020-NYF-84-4.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism: narrow toothless snout and stiff armoured back. Not a whale, isolated skull or Parahupehsuchus body tube. [\"2023 filter-feeding inference is challenged by2025 PeerJ19666; preserve uncertainty, no invented whale soft tissues.\", \"Colour, skin, exact flesh depth and paddle outline inferred. Fossil compression not living body thickness; distal tail outline reconstructed, not fully shown in figure.\", \"Do not substitute related short-necked Eohupehsuchus proportions or Parahupehsuchus extreme bony body tube.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.0, \"basis\": \"Chen et al.2014 discussion places Hupehsuchus around1m. Genus-level reconstruction target, not measured length of2020-NYF-84-4.\"}"
  },
